        Cafeína
+------------------------+   +------------------------+   +------------------------+
|       SMILES           |   |    Grafo molecular     |   |     Fingerprint        |
|                        |   |                        |   |                        |
| CN1C=NC2=C1C(=O)       |   |       N---C--N         |   | [0,1,0,1,1,0,...,0,1]  |
| N(C(=O)N2C)C           |   |      /|       \\        |   |                        |
|                        |   |     C |        N        |   |   ~2048 bits           |
|  string, legible       |   |     | C---C---/        |   |                        |
|  formato estándar      |   |     N |   |             |   |  binario fijo:         |
|  (ZINC, ChEMBL)        |   |     | C===O             |   |  1 = la molécula       |
|                        |   |     C                   |   |      contiene cierta   |
|                        |   |     |                   |   |      subestructura     |
|                        |   |     CH3 ...             |   |                        |
+------------------------+   +------------------------+   +------------------------+
